<title>USA: Abraxas Petroleum sets $215 mln 144A notes.</title>
<headline>Abraxas Petroleum sets $215 mln 144A notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Abraxas Petroleum was priced via BT Securities Tuesday, according to market sources.</p>
<p>BORROWER ABRAXAS PETROLEUM</p>
<p>AMT $215 MLN	 COUPON 11.50 PCT  MATURITY 11/01/2004</p>
<p>TYPE SENIOR NOTES  ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE N.A.</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B2    YIELD 11.50 PCT   PAY FREQ N.A.</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-B  SPREAD N.A.	 CALLABLE AFTER FOUR YEARS</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
